keeps: ahead of | before any | before every | before the | before those | before all | first line | first child
bars: \bthat is why\b | \binsertadjustmentnote\b
why: Kirill could not link "that is why" to the fact before it; the act names the thing in the fact it satisfies, so the note is inserted first, ahead of the posting and reversal lines the format orders after it
labelled: 2026-09-30
--- code
export function insertAdjustmentNote(section: Section, note: AdjustmentNote): void {
  section.insertBefore(note, section.firstLine);
}
--- facts
The clearing format orders adjustment notes before any posting line or reversal line in a section.
